AXES builds on open published standards, including RFC 8785 (JSON Canonicalization
Scheme), FIPS 180-4 (SHA-256), RFC 7515 (JWS), RFC 9052 and RFC 9053 (COSE),
RFC 3161 (Time-Stamp Protocol), RFC 6962 (Certificate Transparency), RFC 6920
(Naming Things with Hashes), and ISO 20022. See PROVENANCE.md for the full mapping.

AXES adopts JCS canonicalisation as defined in RFC 8785 and cites that RFC as its
source. AXES signatures profile over JWS and COSE and do not incorporate
post-quantum or zero-knowledge signature constructions. AXES content-addresses
over the field sets defined in this repository.

Contributions are credited to their authors, per component, in
registers/decision-register.md. See PROVENANCE.md for contributor credits.
